{"strongs": "H2344", "word": "חוֺל", "translit": "chol", "root": "חול", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "sand", "definition": "חוֺל noun masculine Hos 2:1 sand (perhaps as turning or whirling ; otherwise explained by Sta , see below חֲוִילָה ; Late Hebrew id. , Aramaic חָלָא , ) — ׳ ח absolute Gen 22:17 + 15 t.; construct Gen 32:13 + 6 t.; — sand Exod 2:12 ( E ); set as bound for sea Jer 5:22 ׳ שְׂפֻנֵי טמוני ח Deut 33:19 hidden treasures of sand , poetic for glass (regarded as mysteriously produced out of sand, see Di and references); \\ \\ a. usually sand of seashore, simile of numberlessness, vastness, so of Abraham's seed Gen 22:17 ( J ; compare Gen 15:5 ); Jacob's Gen 32:13 ( E ) of a host Josh 11:4 ( J E ), Judg 7:12 ; 1Sam 13:5 ; 2Sam 17:11 a people 1Kgs 4:20 ; Hos 2:1 ; Isa 10:22 ; Isa 48:19 (|| וְצֶאֱצָאֵי מֶעֶיךָ כִּמְעֹתָ֑יו ), Jer 33:22 ; Hab 1:9 of corn gathered by Joseph Gen 41:49 of days of Job Job 29:18 (on interpretation = phoenix , see Di ); of birds עוף כנף (i.e. quails) Ps 78:27 (|| כֶּעָפָר ); of vast extent of Solomon's wisdom 1Kgs 5:9 . \\ \\ b. in compare, more than the sand Jer 15:8 (widows of Judah); thoughts of God Ps 139:18 . \\ \\ c. of weight (in balances), metaphor of Job's vexation ( כַּעַשׂ ) Job 6:3 heavier than the sand, compare וְנֵטֶל הַחוֺל Prov 27:3 (|| כֹּבֶד אֶבֶן ), said of כַּעַס אֱוִיל . — Combinations are: ׳ כח אשׁר על שׂפת הים Gen 22:17 ; Josh 11:4 ; 1Sam 13:5 ; 1Kgs 5:9 הַיָּם ׳ כח Gen 32:13 ; Gen 41:49 ; Isa 10:22 ; Hos 2:1 (+ אשׁר לא יִמַּד ולא יִסָּפֵר ); הַיָּם ׳ ח Jer 33:22 שֶׁעַלשֿׂפת הים לרב ׳ כח Judg 7:12 אשׁרעֿלהֿים לרב ׳ כח 2Sam 17:11 ; 1Kgs 4:20 (מ)חול יַמִּים Job 6:3 ; Ps 78:27 ; Jer 15:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2609')\">BDB2609</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2344')\">H2344</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2608')\">BDB2608</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2610')\">BDB2610</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חוֺל</b